  "details": "Thank you very much for your continued efforts in the development and operation of the service.\n\nCurrently, the UdonBehaviours attached to the VRCWorld prefab do not have a consistent Synchronization mode.\n\nAs a result, unintended synchronization may occur when using the prefab in a project, which can cause confusion for creators.\n\nIf all of these could be unified to None, it would make the prefab clearer and safer to use for everyone.\n\nI would greatly appreciate your consideration of this request. Thank you very much in advance.",
